# Subagent model (no Fast)

When calling the Task tool, turn Fast off if a non-fast model slug is available.

- Never pass a slug ending in `-fast` unless the user explicitly asked for Fast.
- If inherit would pick a fast model (parent is `composer-2.5-fast` or another `*-fast` slug), pass the listed non-fast sibling (`composer-2.5`).
- Otherwise pass `inherit` (or omit `model`) so the subagent stays in the parent family.
- Do not switch model families just to avoid Fast.
